  📗
    Serves *app* on *port* until a stop is requested, by SIGTERM, SIGINT or
    🛑 on the app. Returns 0 after a clean stop and 1 when it could not start.
    If workers are still busy when the grace period ends, the process exits
    with 1 instead of returning.
